From 379f830f0a1bc8d46ce0f198306daccf2c3da9d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: morgonf <morgonf@altlinux.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:10:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 18/21] software_isp: Remosaic full size Quad Bayer frames
 (IMX371)

The IMX371 has a Quad Bayer colour filter. Its binned mode is an
ordinary Bayer mosaic, full size frames are not. Swapping pixels 1 and 2
of every group of four in both directions gives an ordinary RGGB mosaic:
the GPU debayer reads its samples from the swapped positions and the CPU
statistics take one pixel of each colour two pixels apart.
---
